description:
At Herringbone & Sui, impeccable artisan-ship combines with unparalleled technology to create a garment that is not only classic and built to last but stitched exactly to the client’s fit. Herringbone & Sui was built with the vision of bringing first class, international quality menswear to India for discerning men who enjoy the finer things in life. The brand intends on expanding to 22 more locations worldwide, by 2021.

Key Facts -
• Made-to-measure patterns and try-on garments crafted in collaboration with legendary avant-garde Napoli Master Pattern Maker;
• Garments are crafted using artisanal Neapolitan techniques;
• Luxurious fabrics sourced from internationally renowned mills.
